  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## LEVEL 3 \u2014 THE WORK AGENT\n(the $35/month 'AI employee' \u2014 free)\nIT decides the next step across your real work:\n\u00b7 reads your inbox \u2192 tells you what needs you\n\u00b7 WRITES reply drafts (never sends \u2014 you stay in control)\n\u00b7 briefs your meetings from calendar + email context\n\u00b7 does your invoice math\nNobody tells it which tool. That's the whole difference.",
    "height": 205,
    "width": 350,
    "color": 4
   },
   "id": "n3",
   "name": "Sticky L3",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
